Comment: 0,0:00:57.41,0:00:59.96,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是没用的 Don't care about me baby
Comment: 0,0:00:59.96,0:01:01.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I'm burning yeah
Comment: 0,0:01:01.71,0:01:04.67,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重生后的Stage
Comment: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:07.05,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}We're gonna run this town tonight
