Comment: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:10.80,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Into the fire
Comment: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:25.40,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无法夺走的Story
Comment: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:27.32,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就只是一人独自生存
Comment: 0,0:01:27.32,0:01:29.24,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外出便是暴风雨Stormy
Comment: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:30.57,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钟声响起 Ding Ding Dong
Comment: 0,0:01:30.57,0:01:31.70,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Like a King Kong
Comment: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:34.95,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Top 10的任务 完成后自己就是队长
Comment: 0,0:01:34.95,0:01:35.70,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Can't stop
Comment: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:36.87,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Re:Monster
Comment: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:38.58,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从零开始的转生Big game
Comment: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:40.45,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赌下的钱财全部输光
Comment: 0,0:01:40.45,0:01:41.41,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但I don't care
Comment: 0,0:01:41.41,0:01:42.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}We got the dough
Comment: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:43.12,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Hey Can you see me?
Comment: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:44.04,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好好享受
Comment: 0,0:01:44.04,0:01:45.75,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在街上将毛帽深深戴上
Comment: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:47.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不讨厌的Battle
Comment: 0,0:01:47.13,0:01:48.84,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我天生报酬就是Double
Comment: 0,0:01:48.84,0:01:50.84,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我所吞下的Glory
Comment: 0,0:01:50.84,0:01:52.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将会就此成为我的血肉
Comment: 0,0:01:52.63,0:01:55.59,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有意义 Set me free
Comment: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:58.10,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是没用的 Don't care about me baby
