Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.88,0:01:46.93,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我可是从不厌战
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.97,0:01:48.75,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}谁叫我报酬总是拿双份
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.29,0:01:50.75,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}吃进去多少都是荣耀
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.89,0:01:52.50,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}最终像这样成为我血肉
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.71,0:01:55.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}囚禁我毫无意义 放我自由
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.65,0:01:58.09,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我不必无用的担心 baby
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.14,0:01:59.82,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我正在燃烧 yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.98,0:02:02.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}转生在这个舞台
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.92,0:02:04.97,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我们今夜定会横穿这城市
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.18,0:02:06.52,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}让我们开始吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.54,0:02:08.21,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,0)\move(960,1065,960,1130,1570,1670)}{\t(500,550,\fscx125\fscy60)}沐浴烈焰
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.09,0:02:08.65,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\move(960,1040,960,1065,1020,1120)\fad(50,100)}人生就像游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.80,0:02:10.48,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}“绝对”只是假象
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.63,0:02:12.31,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}常识直接打碎
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.55,0:02:16.24,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,0)\move(960,1065,960,1130,3590,3690)}{\t(2130,2180,\fscx125\fscy60)}我们浴火而生在当下
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.73,0:02:15.93,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\pos(960,1040)\fad(50,100)}人生就像游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.05,0:02:17.74,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)\move(960,1040,960,1065,90,190)}“绝对”只是假象
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.92,0:02:19.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}常识直接打碎
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.79,0:02:21.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我们浴火而生
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.11,0:02:23.43,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}前往下片天地
